[Desktop Entry]
Name=Consertar Problemas (Rice Doctor)
Name[en]=Fix Problems (Rice Doctor)
Comment=Verifica o sistema e conserta sozinho: som, rede, interface, pacotes, espaço em disco
Comment[en]=Checks the system and fixes it: sound, network, interface, packages, disk space
